### Ingest one tenant-scoped event
POST http://localhost:8001/events
X-Tenant-ID: tenant_demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "tenant_demo",
  "event_type": "order.created",
  "source_service": "api-client",
  "payload": {
    "order_id": "ord_local_001",
    "customer_id": "cust_001",
    "product_id": "prod_001",
    "quantity": 2,
    "unit_price": 49.0,
    "discount_amount": 5.0,
    "status": "created",
    "channel": "web",
    "marketing_campaign_id": "paid-search",
    "region": "na"
  }
}

### Issue local JWT
POST http://localhost:8004/auth/token
X-Tenant-ID: tenant_demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "tenant_demo",
  "user_id": "analyst_demo",
  "role": "tenant_analyst",
  "scopes": ["metrics:read", "events:write"],
  "expires_in_seconds": 3600
}

### Query cached revenue metrics
GET http://localhost:8003/metrics/revenue?tenant_id=tenant_demo&limit=7
X-Tenant-ID: tenant_demo

### Platform admin tenant list
GET http://localhost:8004/tenants
X-Tenant-ID: tenant_demo
X-User-Role: platform_admin
